; Pen plotter - Elegoo Centauri Carbon
; Source: <runtime home>/work/layout.gcode
; ccplotter-run: <run id removed>
; PRE-FLIGHT: Home printer WITHOUT pen first (G28 from touchscreen), then attach pen.
; end_policy: release | postamble: v1 (donor-derived, 2026-07-09)
;
; ABSOLUTE MACHINE COORDINATES - no G92 offset.
; The drawing is pre-translated to its machine position, so re-running without
; re-homing lands in the SAME physical spot, and the firmware's abort/cancel
; macro (which moves in machine coords) no longer overshoots into the frame.
;
G21
G90
T0
M117 Plotting...
; (G28 removed to prevent crashes with pen attached)
M107
M106 S0
M106 P2 S0
M106 P3 S0
; Use the higher TRAVEL clearance for the long initial cross-plate sweep.
